    2 B      -1.967   -1.782    1.251   -2.009   -2.033    0.958   -1.979   -1.539    1.482    0.231
    3 H      -0.071   -1.346   -0.417   -0.109   -1.210   -0.319   -0.106   -1.388   -0.494   -0.077
